OL,4,CUS to blacklist Asian AI firm          
OL,5,CMegaspeed after Nvidia scandal         
OL,6,GThe US has said it intends to ban a    
OL,7,GSingaporean artificial intelligence    
OL,8,G(AI) company allegedly tied to the     
OL,9,GNvidia scandal from doing business in  
OL,10,GAmerica.                               
OL,12,FThe Department of Commerce announced   
OL,13,Fit planned to add Megaspeed Ltd to a   
OL,14,Flist of entities that are blacklisted  
OL,15,Ffrom buying or selling goods in the US.
OL,17,FThe company is mainly a developer of   
OL,18,Fdata centres, but in recent weeks a    
OL,19,Fformer executive of Megaspeed was      
OL,20,Faccused of working as a spy for China  
OL,21,Fwhile having a romantic relationship   
OL,22,Fwith Nvidia head Jensen Huang.    G3/6 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
